{"version":3,"term":{"cols":80,"rows":24},"timestamp":1790102829,"command":"docker run -t --rm -v /Users/crtah/Data/5-swarm/2-projects/git-swarm:/work --add-host=host.docker.internal:host-gateway --env-file /var/folders/ky/ms6htv7j6sv5q43hw0gt0bbm0000gn/T/tmp.ss2cjyQ0lw git-swarm/harness bash -lc './tests/stack/demo-story.sh'","title":"git-swarm: archive a Radicle repository to Swarm and get it back","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.126, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[1mgit-swarm — archiving a Radicle repository to Swarm, and getting it back\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2mEvery command below is real. Nothing is mocked or pre-baked.\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.005, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[1m── 1. A Radicle repository \u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.330, "o", "   created rad:z3WWQbZLFCAT7u9v1zs1EcbKsZt18\r\r\n\u001b[2m$ cd /rad/demo-origin/storage/z3WWQbZLFCAT7u9v1zs1EcbKsZt18\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.005, "o", "\u001b[2m$ git for-each-ref --format='%(objecttype) %(refname)'\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "commit refs/heads/main\r\r\ncommit refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/cobs/xyz.radicle.id/1a973a0657…\r\r\ncommit refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/heads/main\r\r\ncommit refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/id\r\r\ncommit refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/root\r\r\ncommit refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/sigrefs\r\r\ncommit refs/rad/id\r\r\n"]
[2.007, "o", "\u001b[2m   Branches AND self-certification: refs/rad/sigrefs is what proves\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m   to anyone that these refs really came from their author.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1m── 2. Archive it to Swarm \u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.006, "o", "\u001b[2m   A forced refspec, because an archive tracks its source rather than\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m   defending a branch from it.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m$ cd /rad/demo-origin/storage/z3WWQbZLFCAT7u9v1zs1EcbKsZt18\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.002, "o", "\u001b[2m$ git push 'bzz::0xf39Fd6e51aad88F6F4ce6aB8827279cffFb92266/demo-1790102829' '+refs/*:refs/*' 2>&1 | tail -6\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.834, "o", " * [new reference]   refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/cobs/xyz.radicle.id/1a973a0657… -> refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/cobs/xyz.radicle.id/1a973a0657…\r\r\n * [new reference]   refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/heads/main -> refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/heads/main\r\r\n * [new reference]   refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/id -> refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/id\r\r\n * [new reference]   refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/root -> refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/root\r\r\n * [new reference]   refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/sigrefs -> refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/sigrefs\r\r\n * [new reference]   refs/rad/id -> refs/rad/id\r\r\n"]
[2.003, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[1m── 3. Now lose everything \u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.005, "o", "\u001b[2m   Not a simulation: the storage, the identity, the keys, all deleted.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m$ rm -rf /rad/demo-origin\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.007, "o", "\u001b[2m$ ls /rad/demo-origin 2>&1 || echo '   gone.'\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "ls: /rad/demo-origin: No such file or directory\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "   gone.\r\r\n"]
[2.007, "o", "\u001b[2m   On the real network this is every seeder going away. The repository\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m   is now unreachable by any Radicle peer.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1m── 4. Restore, holding nothing but a bzz reference \u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.154, "o", "\u001b[2m   A different machine. A different identity. No postage batch and no\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m   signing key — reading an archive must never require paying to read it.\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "\u001b[2m$ cd /rad/demo-restored/storage/z3WWQbZLFCAT7u9v1zs1EcbKsZt18\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.005, "o", "\u001b[2m$ env -u SWARM_BATCH_ID -u SWARM_PRIVATE_KEY git fetch 'bzz::0xf39Fd6e51aad88F6F4ce6aB8827279cffFb92266/demo-1790102829' '+refs/*:refs/*' 2>&1 | tail -4\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[1.230, "o", " * [new ref]         refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/id -> refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/id\r\r\n * [new ref]         refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/root -> refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/root\r\r\n * [new ref]         refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/sigrefs -> refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/sigrefs\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " * [new ref]         refs/rad/id -> refs/rad/id\r\r\n"]
[2.001, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[1m── 5. Is it really the same repository? \u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.006, "o", "\u001b[2m$ git for-each-ref --format='%(objecttype) %(refname)'\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "commit refs/heads/main\r\r\ncommit refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/cobs/xyz.radicle.id/1a973a0657…\r\r\ncommit refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/heads/main\r\r\ncommit refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/id\r\r\ncommit refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/root\r\r\ncommit refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/sigrefs\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "commit refs/rad/id\r\r\n"]
[2.004, "o", "\u001b[2m$ git fsck --no-progress --no-dangling && echo '   fsck: clean'\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "notice: HEAD points to an unborn branch (master)\r\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "   fsck: clean\r\r\n"]
[2.006, "o", "\u001b[2m   And Radicle itself accepts it — identity and delegates recovered\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m   from the archive, by an identity that has never seen this repo:\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m$ RAD_HOME=/rad/demo-restored rad inspect --identity rad:z3WWQbZLFCAT7u9v1zs1EcbKsZt18 | head -14\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "{\r\r\n  \"payload\": {\r\r\n    \"xyz.radicle.project\": {\r\r\n      \"defaultBranch\": \"main\",\r\r\n      \"description\": \"git-swarm archive fixture\",\r\r\n      \"name\": \"fixture\"\r\r\n    }\r\r\n  },\r\r\n  \"delegates\": [\r\r\n    \"did:key:z6MknitdHNL4ZwobVget98s8BKRKu2pUXdALiZmBVbk1ueKT\"\r\r\n  ],\r\r\n  \"threshold\": 1\r\r\n}\r\r\n"]
[2.007, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[1m── 6. Put it back on the network \u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.005, "o", "\u001b[2m$ RAD_HOME=/rad/demo-restored rad seed rad:z3WWQbZLFCAT7u9v1zs1EcbKsZt18 2>&1 | tail -1\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[0.012, "o", "✓ Seeding policy updated for rad:z3WWQbZLFCAT7u9v1zs1EcbKsZt18 with scope 'followed'\r\r\n"]
[3.010, "o", "\u001b[2m   node started\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[0.005, "o", "\u001b[2m$ RAD_HOME=/rad/demo-restored rad node inventory\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[36mrad:z3WWQbZLFCAT7u9v1zs1EcbKsZt18\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "\u001b[2m   Inventory is what a node announces it will serve. The repository is\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m   back on the network, from an archive, after every peer was gone.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1m── 7. And it is readable with no Radicle at all \u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.019, "o", "\u001b[2m   A PATH with git, node and the helper — and nothing from Radicle:\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m$ PATH=/tmp/demo-bin command -v rad || echo '   rad: not found'\u001b[0m\r\r\n   rad: not found\r\r\n"]
[2.010, "o", "\u001b[2m$ cd /tmp/demo-plain.git\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[2.002, "o", "\u001b[2m$ PATH=/tmp/demo-bin env -u SWARM_BATCH_ID -u SWARM_PRIVATE_KEY git fetch 'bzz::0xf39Fd6e51aad88F6F4ce6aB8827279cffFb92266/demo-1790102829' '+refs/*:refs/*' 2>&1 | tail -3\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[1.210, "o", " * [new ref]         refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/root -> refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/root\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " * [new ref]         refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/sigrefs -> refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/rad/sigrefs\r\r\n * [new ref]         refs/rad/id -> refs/rad/id\r\r\n"]
[2.007, "o", "\u001b[2m$ PATH=/tmp/demo-bin git for-each-ref --count=3 --format='%(refname)'\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "refs/heads/main\r\r\nrefs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/cobs/xyz.radicle.id/1a973a0657…\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "refs/namespaces/z6MknitdHNL4…/refs/heads/main\r\r\n"]
[2.007, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[1m── Done \u001b[0m\r\r\n   Archived to Swarm, lost completely, restored by a stranger,\r\r\n   re-seeded onto the network, and readable with stock git alone.\r\r\n\r\r\n   Clone it with the helper:\r\r\n     git clone bzz::0xf39Fd6e51aad88F6F4ce6aB8827279cffFb92266/demo-1790102829\r\r\n\r\r\n   Or browse it: the push above printed a feed manifest reference.\r\r\n   Open the viewer against this cluster with\r\r\n     ?gateway=$SWARM_GATEWAY#bzz/<that reference>\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.137, "x", "0"]
